#chip mega328p, 16

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 2 ms, Wait 3 ms and Wait 200 us in one body
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 1,600,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim X As Byte

Repeat for 100 ms
    Wait 2 ms
    X = X + 1
    Wait 3 ms
    Wait 200 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
